From: wslg_remake local experimental work
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] rdprail: map native input panels with owned nonactivating RAIL windows

Pinned Weston a7e35fdab455dce5774b43b8aff682f748307e31, after patches 1 and 2.
Local custom IME support; original-application success reported on 2026-11-14.
Individual edge cases and long-duration stability are not fully accepted.
Requires the matching RDP backend and RAIL shell, plus the trusted-FD bridge.

